@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### Latest club tournament season
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments

### Explicit season
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments?season=2026

### Competition detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/10?season=2026

### Current-season fixture detail (replace with an ingested external fixture ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/fixtures/1591866?season=2026

### Dashboard resolves today or nearest available date
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/dashboard?season=2026

### Dashboard for an explicit date
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/dashboard?season=2026&date=2026-08-15

### Missing competition for season (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/999999?season=2026
